{"ticker":"SMCI","updated":"2026-10-24T00:01:07Z","profile":{"longName":"Super Micro Computer, Inc.","shortName":"Super Micro Computer, Inc.","sector":"Technology","industry":"Computer Hardware","country":"United States","website":"https://www.supermicro.com","fullTimeEmployees":7000,"marketCap":21640437760,"trailingPE":10.104294,"forwardPE":5.895112,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":0.5539871,"pegRatio":0.91,"targetMeanPrice":43.26667,"targetHighPrice":60.0,"targetLowPrice":15.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":15,"recommendationKey":"hold","revenueGrowth":0.932,"earningsGrowth":4.347,"grossMargins":0.108219996,"operatingMargins":0.13382,"profitMargins":0.0571,"totalRevenue":39063072768,"beta":2.009,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":54.08,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":19.48,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.0},"summary":"Super Micro Computer, Inc., together with its subsidiaries, develops and sells server and storage solutions based on modular and open-standard architecture in the United States, Asia, Europe, and internationally. The company offers liquid and air-cooled AI servers for training and inferencing with integrated graphics processing units (GPUs) or PCIe based architectures; SuperBlade, MicroBlade, FlexTwin, GrandTwin, and BigTwin blade and multi-node systems; SuperStorage systems; Hyper, CloudDC, and WIO and rackmount systems; embedded (5G/IoT/Edge) systems; and MicroCloud server systems. It also provides workstations and networking devices; and modular server subsystems and accessories, including server boards, chassis, power supplies, and other accessories. In addition, the company offers remote system management solutions, such as Server Management suite comprising Supermicro Server Manager, Supermicro Power Management software, Supermicro Update Manager, SuperCloud Composer, SuperCloud Director, and SuperDoctor 5. Further, the company identifies service requirements; creates and executes project plans; conducts verification testing; offers training; and provides technical documentation. Additionally, it provides rack level services from design to deployment for full rack and cluster level deployments of AI and HPC datacenters; help desk services and on-site product support; and ","summary_zh":"Super Micro Computer, Inc. 及其子公司在美國、亞洲、歐洲和國際上開發和銷售基於模組化和開放標準架構的伺服器和儲存解決方案。該公司提供液冷和風冷 AI 伺服器，用於使用整合式圖形處理單元 (GPU) 或基於 PCIe 的架構進行訓練和推理； SuperBlade、MicroBlade、FlexTwin、GrandTwin 和 BigTwin 刀鋒和多節點系統；超級儲存系統；它還提供工作站和網路設備；模組化伺服器子系統和配件，包括伺服器主機板、機箱、電源和其他配件。此外，該公司還提供遠端系統管理解決方案，例如伺服器管理套件，其中包括 Supermicro Server Manager、Supermicro 電源管理軟體、Supermicro Update Manager、SuperCloud Composer、SuperCloud Director 和 SuperDoctor 5。此外，該公司還確定了服務需求；創建並執行專案計劃；進行驗證測試；提供培訓；並提供技術文件。此外，它還為人工智慧和高效能運算資料中心的全機架和叢集級部署提供從設計到部署的機架級服務；幫助台服務和現場產品支援；和","sector_zh":"科技","industry_zh":"電腦硬體","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":43.6,"h":44.93,"l":43.28,"c":44.07,"v":18782000},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":44.06,"h":44.39,"l":43.64,"c":44.36,"v":18168200},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":44.37,"h":45.01,"l":43.87,"c":44.76,"v":18925100},{"t":"2025-08-28","o":44.82,"h":45.34,"l":43.91,"c":43.97,"v":22120100},{"t":"2025-08-29","o":42.8,"h":42.86,"l":41.44,"c":41.54,"v":36835900},{"t":"2025-09-02","o":40.03,"h":40.86,"l":39.56,"c":40.78,"v":29924300},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":40.9,"h":40.98,"l":39.77,"c":40.1,"v":20472800},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":40.28,"h":40.8,"l":39.75,"c":40.7,"v":22479400},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":40.99,"h":41.18,"l":39.74,"c":40.41,"v":21771700},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":40.9,"h":41.12,"l":39.89,"c":40.04,"v":19033300},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":40.24,"h":43.0,"l":40.17,"c":42.92,"v":37459000},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":44.0,"h":45.57,"l":43.33,"c":43.91,"v":40876000},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":44.29,"h":44.51,"l":43.46,"c":43.95,"v":24437700},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":46.56,"h":47.0,"l":44.63,"c":45.0,"v":38138300},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":45.23,"h":45.77,"l":44.2,"c":45.38,"v":22441800},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":45.55,"h":45.82,"l":44.5,"c":44.91,"v":18139200},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":44.6,"h":45.4,"l":43.69,"